# Committed nflverse CSV caches under data/nfl/nflverse/ are byte/sha256
# verified against their manifest.json entries (scripts/lib/nfl-source-cache.mjs
# verifyCacheEntry), which record the hash of the original upstream (LF)
# bytes at commit time. Pin these files to LF on checkout so that contract
# holds on every platform, regardless of core.autocrlf -- without this,
# Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true can smudge CRLF into these files
# on checkout, changing byteSize/sha256 with no actual content change and
# breaking cache verification.
data/nfl/nflverse/**/*.csv text eol=lf
